# Compose variables for YOUR copy of this stack: copy to docker/local/.env
# (gitignored) and edit. Compose reads it when it builds and starts the services;
# `dck up` and `dck rebuild` read it too.
#
# The coding-agent CLIs installed in your image, within the CLIs this repository
# wires (their home volumes, your host profiles):
#   wired: claude codex cursor opencode pi cline grok
#   installed by default (dck.toml clis): claude codex cursor opencode pi cline grok
# This repository wires only the CLIs chosen at onboarding; you can install fewer:
# DCK_AGENT_CLIS="claude codex cursor opencode pi cline grok"
# Any other CLI needs [agents] supported in dck.toml (advanced mode, docs/config.md).
